  "title": "Lombardy 倫巴底 - 氣泡酒之鄉",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#95a5a6 0%,#bdc3c7 100%)'><h1>🥂 Lombardy 倫巴底</h1><p class='subtitle'>Franciacorta 與米蘭的優雅之地</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🗺️ Lombardy 產區地圖</h2><div class='map-slide-container'><div id='lombardy-map' class='lombardy-region-map'></div><div class='map-legend' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(26,26,46,0.95),rgba(26,26,46,0.98));backdrop-filter:blur(15px);border-radius:16px;padding:30px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)'><h3 style='margin:0 0 25px;color:#fff;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;text-align:center;border-bottom:3px solid rgba(243,156,18,0.8);padding-bottom:12px'>圖例說明</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600'>🌍 大區邊界</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 0'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:rgba(243,156,18,0.15);border:3px solid #f1c40f;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>倫巴底大區範圍</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600'>🍷 產區分級（DOCG/DOC 邊界）</h4><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#d4af37;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(212,175,55,0.6)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>S級 - Franciacorta DOCG</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e74c3c;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(231,76,60,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>A級 - Oltrepò Pavese MC DOCG</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e67e22;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(230,126,34,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>A級 - Valtellina Superiore DOCG</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#3498db;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(52,152,219,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>B級 - Lugana DOC</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#5dade2;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(93,173,226,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>B級 - Sforzato di Valtellina DOCG</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#85c1e9;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(133,193,233,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>B級 - Valtellina Rosso DOC</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#f39c12;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(243,156,18,0.6)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>重要城市</span></div></div></div><div style='background:rgba(102,126,234,0.15);border-radius:10px;padding:18px;margin-top:5px;border:1px solid rgba(102,126,234,0.3)'><p style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem'>💡 地圖操作提示：</p><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);line-height:1.8;list-style:none'><li style='padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500'>🖱️ 滑鼠滾輪縮放地圖</li><li style='padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500'>🖐️ 拖曳移動視角</li><li style='padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500'>📍 點擊區域查看產區詳情</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📍 產區概況</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-card'><div class='card-icon'>📍</div><div class='card-content'><h3>地理位置</h3><p>義大利北部，鄰近瑞士</p><p>首府：<strong>米蘭 (Milano)</strong></p></div></div><div class='intro-card'><div class='card-icon'>🏔️</div><div class='card-content'><h3>地形特色</h3><p>阿爾卑斯山麓</p><p>眾多冰川湖泊（Como, Garda, Iseo）</p></div></div><div class='intro-card'><div class='card-icon'>🌾</div><div class='card-content'><h3>葡萄園面積</h3><p>~27,000 公頃</p><p>5 DOCG + 21 DOC</p></div></div><div class='intro-card'><div class='card-icon'>🥂</div><div class='card-content'><h3>特色酒款</h3><p>Franciacorta DOCG</p><p>義大利最頂級氣泡酒</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌟 Franciacorta DOCG</h2><div class='franciacorta-showcase'><div class='showcase-header'><h3>🏆 義大利香檳</h3><p>採用傳統香檳法（Metodo Classico）釀造</p></div><div class='showcase-grid'><div class='showcase-detail'><h4>🍇 法定品種</h4><ul><li><strong>Chardonnay</strong> - 主要白葡萄</li><li><strong>Pinot Nero (Pinot Noir)</strong> - 紅葡萄</li><li><strong>Pinot Bianco</strong> - 白葡萄</li></ul></div><div class='showcase-detail'><h4>⏱️ 陳年要求</h4><table class='aging-table'><tr><td><strong>Non-vintage</strong></td><td>18 個月</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Satèn</strong></td><td>24 個月</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Millesimato</strong></td><td>30 個月</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Riserva</strong></td><td>60 個月</td></tr></table></div></div><div class='showcase-styles'><h4>🍾 風格分類</h4><div class='style-cards'><div class='style-card'><div class='style-name'>Franciacorta</div><div class='style-desc'>經典款，白葡萄或混釀</div><div class='style-pressure'>氣壓: 正常</div></div><div class='style-card saten'><div class='style-name'>Satèn</div><div class='style-desc'>僅用白葡萄，口感絲滑</div><div class='style-pressure'>氣壓: 較低（更細緻）</div></div><div class='style-card rose'><div class='style-name'>Rosé</div><div class='style-desc'>加入 Pinot Nero</div><div class='style-pressure'>粉紅色澤</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🆚 Franciacorta vs Champagne</h2><div class='comparison-grid'><div class='comp-header champagne-col'><h3>🇫🇷 Champagne</h3></div><div class='comp-header franciacorta-col'><h3>🇮🇹 Franciacorta</h3></div><div class='comp-row'><div class='comp-label'>產地</div><div class='champagne-col'>法國香檳區</div><div class='franciacorta-col'>義大利倫巴底</div></div><div class='comp-row'><div class='comp-label'>氣候</div><div class='champagne-col'>大陸性（寒冷）</div><div class='franciacorta-col'>溫和（湖泊調節）</div></div><div class='comp-row'><div class='comp-label'>土壤</div><div class='champagne-col'>白堊土</div><div class='franciacorta-col'>冰川沉積</div></div><div class='comp-row'><div class='comp-label'>釀造法</div><div class='champagne-col'>傳統香檳法</div><div class='franciacorta-col'>傳統香檳法（Metodo Classico）</div></div><div class='comp-row'><div class='comp-label'>品種</div><div class='champagne-col'>Chardonnay, Pinot Noir, Meunier</div><div class='franciacorta-col'>Chardonnay, Pinot Nero, Pinot Bianco</div></div><div class='comp-row'><div class='comp-label'>風格</div><div class='champagne-col'>清爽、高酸、礦物感</div><div class='franciacorta-col'>果香豐富、柔順、優雅</div></div><div class='comp-row'><div class='comp-label'>價格</div><div class='champagne-col'>$$$-$$$$</div><div class='franciacorta-col'>$$-$$$</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 其他重要產區</h2><div class='other-regions'><div class='region-card valtellina'><div class='region-badge'>DOCG</div><h3>Valtellina Superiore</h3><div class='region-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>靠近瑞士的山區</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Nebbiolo（當地稱 Chiavennasca）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>優雅紅酒，高酸度</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>陡峭山坡梯田葡萄園</p><p><strong>子產區：</strong>Grumello, Inferno, Sassella, Valgella</p></div></div><div class='region-card oltrepo'><div class='region-badge'>DOC/DOCG</div><h3>Oltrepò Pavese</h3><div class='region-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>倫巴底南部</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Pinot Nero, Barbera, Croatina</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>紅酒、白酒、氣泡酒皆有</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>產量大，性價比高</p><p><strong>亮點：</strong>Oltrepò Pavese Metodo Classico DOCG</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 配餐建議</h2><div class='pairing-section'><div class='pairing-group'><h4>🥂 Franciacorta</h4><div class='pairing-items'><div class='pairing-item'>🦪 <strong>生蠔</strong> - Satèn 最佳</div><div class='pairing-item'>🍤 <strong>龍蝦</strong> - Millesimato 搭配</div><div class='pairing-item'>🍄 <strong>松露燉飯</strong> - 倫巴底特產</div><div class='pairing-item'>🧀 <strong>Gorgonzola 起司</strong> - 地域性完美搭配</div><div class='pairing-item'>🥗 <strong>開胃菜</strong> - Non-vintage 日常飲用</div></div></div><div class='pairing-group'><h4>🍷 Valtellina Superiore</h4><div class='pairing-items'><div class='pairing-item'>🦌 <strong>野味</strong> - 燉鹿肉</div><div class='pairing-item'>🧀 <strong>Bitto 起司</strong> - 當地陳年起司</div><div class='pairing-item'>🍖 <strong>Pizzoccheri</strong> - 蕎麥麵配培根</div><div class='pairing-item'>🥩 <strong>燉牛肉</strong> - 冬季溫暖料理</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>💡 購買指南</h2><div class='buying-tips'><div class='tip-card beginner'><h4>🌱 入門推薦</h4><ul><li>Franciacorta Non-vintage (€20-30)</li><li>Oltrepò Pavese DOC (€10-15)</li></ul><p class='tip-note'>性價比高，適合日常飲用</p></div><div class='tip-card intermediate'><h4>🍷 進階選擇</h4><ul><li>Franciacorta Satèn (€30-45)</li><li>Franciacorta Millesimato (€35-50)</li><li>Valtellina Superiore Riserva (€25-40)</li></ul><p class='tip-note'>品質優異，適合特殊場合</p></div><div class='tip-card premium'><h4>💎 頂級收藏</h4><ul><li>Franciacorta Riserva (€60-100+)</li><li>Sforzato di Valtellina DOCG (€40-70)</li></ul><p class='tip-note'>陳年潛力佳，值得收藏</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Franciacorta 是義大利最頂級的氣泡酒 DOCG</div><div class='point'>✓ 採用與香檳相同的傳統釀造法（Metodo Classico）</div><div class='point'>✓ Satèn 是 Franciacorta 獨有的風格（低氣壓、絲滑）</div><div class='point'>✓ Valtellina 用 Nebbiolo 釀造優雅的高山紅酒</div><div class='point'>✓ 倫巴底以米蘭為中心，擁有豐富的美食文化</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:15px}.intro-card{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}.card-icon{font-size:2.5rem}.card-content h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:#7f8c8d;font-size:1.1rem}.card-content p{margin:5px 0;color:#555;line-height:1.6}.card-content strong{color:#34495e;font-size:1.1rem}.franciacorta-showcase{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.showcase-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:3px solid #bdc3c7}.showcase-header h3{margin:0 0 10px;color:#34495e;font-size:1.6rem}.showcase-header p{margin:0;color:#7f8c8d;font-size:1.1rem}.showcase-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px;margin-bottom:25px}.showcase-detail h4{color:#34495e;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem}.showcase-detail ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.showcase-detail li{color:#555}.aging-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.aging-table td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ecf0f1}.aging-table strong{color:#34495e}.showcase-styles h4{color:#34495e;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem}.style-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px}.style-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ecf0f1,#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-top:4px solid #95a5a6;text-align:center}.style-card.saten{border-color:#f39c12}.style-card.rose{border-color:#e74c3c}.style-name{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:#34495e;margin-bottom:10px}.style-desc{color:#555;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.5}.style-pressure{font-size:.9rem;color:#7f8c8d;font-style:italic}.comparison-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:#bdc3c7;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.comp-header{padding:20px;text-align:center;color:#fff}.comp-header.champagne-col{background:#2c3e50;grid-column:2}.comp-header.franciacorta-col{background:#34495e;grid-column:3}.comp-header h3{margin:0;font-size:1.3rem}.comp-row{display:contents}.comp-label{background:#ecf0f1;padding:15px;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;grid-column:1}.champagne-col{background:#fff;padding:15px;color:#555}.franciacorta-col{background:#f8f9fa;padding:15px;color:#555}.other-regions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.region-card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);position:relative}.region-badge{position:absolute;top:15px;right:15px;background:#95a5a6;color:#fff;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}.region-card h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#34495e;font-size:1.2rem}.region-details p{margin:8px 0;line-height:1.6;font-size:.95rem}.region-details strong{color:#2c3e50}.pairing-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.pairing-group{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.pairing-group h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#34495e;font-size:1.2rem;border-bottom:3px solid #bdc3c7;padding-bottom:10px}.pairing-items{display:grid;gap:12px}.pairing-item{padding:12px 15px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ecf0f1,transparent);border-left:4px solid #95a5a6;color:#2c3e50;line-height:1.6}.buying-tips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.tip-card{padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid}.tip-card.beginner{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e8f5e9,#fff);border-color:#4caf50}.tip-card.intermediate{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff3e0,#fff);border-color:#ff9800}.tip-card.premium{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f3e5f5,#fff);border-color:#9c27b0}.tip-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#2c3e50}.tip-card ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.tip-note{margin-top:15px;padding-top:15px;border-top:2px solid rgba(0,0,0,.1);font-style:italic;color:#555;font-weight:600}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ecf0f1,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #95a5a6;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style><style>.map-slide-container{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:30px;height:calc(100vh - 200px);min-height:500px;padding:20px}.lombardy-region-map{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3);background:#1a1a2e}.map-legend{background:rgba(26,26,46,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:12px;padding:25px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);height:fit-content;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}</style></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#3498db;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(52,152,219,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>B級 - Lugana DOC</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#5dade2;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(93,173,226,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>B級 - Sforzato di Valtellina</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#85c1e9;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(133,193,233,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>B級 - Valtellina Rosso",
  "quiz": [
    {
      "question": "Franciacorta DOCG 採用什麼釀造法？",
      "options": [
        "Charmat 法（罐中發酵）",
        "Metodo Classico（傳統香檳法）",
        "Asti 法",
        "Ancestrale 法"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Franciacorta 採用與香檳相同的傳統釀造法（Metodo Classico），瓶中二次發酵。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Franciacorta Satèn 的特色是？",
      "options": [
        "加入紅葡萄",
        "氣壓較低、口感絲滑",
        "陳年 60 個月",
        "甜型氣泡酒"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Satèn 是 Franciacorta 獨有的風格，僅用白葡萄，氣壓較低，口感更加細緻絲滑。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Franciacorta Riserva 至少需要陳年多久？",
      "options": [
        "18 個月",
        "24 個月",
        "30 個月",
        "60 個月"
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "explanation": "Franciacorta Riserva 需要至少 60 個月（5 年）的陳年，是最高等級的 Franciacorta。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Valtellina 產區主要使用哪個葡萄品種？",
      "options": [
        "Sangiovese",
        "Nebbiolo",
        "Barbera",
        "Corvina"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Valtellina 使用 Nebbiolo 葡萄（當地稱為 Chiavennasca）釀造優雅的紅酒。"
    }
  ]
}
